                <pb facs="0219" n="131" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg131"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-03-26"><hi rendition="#italic">March 26,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay informs Mr. Conger that reports here state that Chinese army is
                    extensively officered by Japanese and asks if report is true.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
